# Typography

## Source of truth
- Tokens and roles for the blueprint type2 experience live in
  `src/app/(frontend)/[locale]/second-homepage-type2/second-homepage-type2.css`
- Reusable component: `Typography` from
  `@/components/second-homepage-type2/typography`
- Project-wide fluid tokens also exist in `globals.css` `@theme inline`
- Full guide: `docs/typography.md`

## Do
- Reuse semantic roles: `shp2-text-display`, `shp2-text-page-title`,
  `shp2-text-section-title`, `shp2-text-subsection-title`,
  `shp2-text-card-title`, `shp2-text-eyebrow`, `shp2-text-lead`,
  `shp2-text-body`, `shp2-text-body-sm`, `shp2-text-caption`,
  `shp2-text-label`, `shp2-text-meta`
- Or use `<Typography variant="sectionTitle" as="h2">`
- Keep one primary `h1` per page
- Preserve semantic heading order (`h1` → `h2` → `h3`)
- Use `rem` / `clamp()` for major headings
- Keep long-form paragraphs roughly `60–75ch` (`shp2-measure`)
- Hero display max-width ~`10–14ch`
- Body text ≥ `1rem`; supporting text ≥ `0.875rem`; avoid `< 0.75rem`
- Body line-height ≥ `1.5` for long copy
- Uppercase labels may use mono + wider tracking; do not uppercase long headings
- Check Romanian diacritics (ă â î ș ț) and EN/RO wrapping
- Keep WCAG AA contrast; do not rely on low-opacity text for essential copy

## Don't
- Arbitrary one-off sizes like `text-[0.58rem]`, random line-heights, or inline font styles
- Choose heading level for visual size alone
- Use `800`/`900` weights unless brand requires it
- Disable browser text resizing or lock text in fixed pixel containers
- Truncate critical content with `line-clamp`
- Duplicate typography rules across components — extend tokens instead

## Fonts (type2)
- Display: Oswald (`--shp-display`)
- Body: Libre Franklin (`--shp-body`)
- Mono labels: IBM Plex Mono (`--shp-mono`) — intentional branded exception
- Loaded via `next/font` with `latin` + `latin-ext`
